    "text": "I, H. R. N. G. Egodagedara, Divisional Secretary, Rambukkana in Kegalle District, do hereby inform under Section 33 of the Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460) that a sum of Rupees One Thousand Four Hundred and Fifty Thousand (Rs. 1,450,000.00), the due amount of compensation for the acquisition of the land indicated in the following Schedule, has been credited under the Case No. LA/08/18 of the District Court of Kegalle in order to receive by the persons entitled thereto.",
